"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MTk5OTY4Mw==&mid=2649662888&idx=1&sn=6e7dd9db2ab33790d39ea081311598a2&chksm=89e65abcfdbc412e03e0b8d20845cb7632691b9254582192207c291e49ff8bbeaff42b4d8a11&scene=126&sessionid=1795488851#rd","description":"光伏商业模式大比较","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FoiaHIzp5rfuMhwCR4akwOhxk8ztQBwSFibSC9bibNvq7ypflh1feZEibIujhwN9GqADjzmfrANukFCWqib5ibcT5yBQS4APiaOYTHuwysDoFzyJaiao%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-15T12:28:55.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MTk5OTY4Mw%3D%3D:2649662870:1","title":"从历史两次暴跌反弹，看懂该持有什么板块？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MTk5OTY4Mw==&mid=2649662870&idx=1&sn=7dc2c2dd6e9d4bff6a1a43171ef8224c&chksm=8984a32b473e29433f5733b4807109ba3beaa72d3fb4fec77964a1e1ee57b35f5b8defa2a4f3&scene=126&sessionid=1795488851#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FoiaHIzp5rfuOiaK6f56d9dricYZAG7YZoz7bI98E5xu7CodMUEquLjQTf16xF9rJhO4vaTXRF0AFr7mUbBgJ6ZNSZkbg9QKsfNgnKIQoIOdtLw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-08T12:29:14.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MTk5OTY4Mw%3D%3D:2649662859:1","title":"散户如何判断上市公司的业绩不及预期 ？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MTk5OTY4Mw==&mid=2649662859&idx=1&sn=80ac70ff8c2c73fe6f3f3e082eb5b933&chksm=891b3995aa6dcb5edaf3c8f713702b41bf8ad0e9a1fbe60d54f2fa935103d0d74f2dbdeb663b&scene=126&sessionid=1795488851#rd","description":"知识星球和圈子的精选问答","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FoiaHIzp5rfuNP2w7aHsytb1D7byGo6iat2NA9HticqnscbsBUyCkhic9YrVibDTy53Jiaic1HhcMtDLrTZ8SiahuvnO4yTs7pic8tJTv2hLPXibogGUTk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-06T12:28:01.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MTk5OTY4Mw%3D%3D:2649662855:1","title":"如果把市场上的投资者分为两类，一类追求高安全边际的合理估值，一类追求高成长带来的高收益。持有同一家成长股，前者对估值的容忍度必然要低于后者。当一家公司体现出其高成长的特点时，后者往往会给出很高的股价预期。\n \n由于A股没有做空机制，只有持股者的卖出才决定股价何时见顶。第一阶段股价见顶，往往是因为前一类投资者对估值的容忍度较低，而这些投资者一旦把股票卖了，就失去了对股价的影响力，相当于把相关公司的筹码结构“洗”成了对估值的容忍度更高的后者。\n \n这就是A股的成长性在达到合理估值后，股价反而加速上涨的原因，股票越涨，越没有做空力量，越不容易跌。\n \n当然，能容忍较大涨幅的投资者，通常也需要更有说服力的逻辑去持股，而这些逻辑能否吸引更多的人相信，就成为行情发展的关键。\n\n下跌的过程是对称的，也有一个跌到合理估值后加速下跌的过程，其原理是：\n \n当一家公司的成长性消失，后者会抛弃该公司，股价一路下跌，一直要跌到前一类投资者认为的高安全边际的估值时，方才止跌。\n \n但这两类投资者的合理估值判断往往中间有一个“合理估值断层”，股票跌到合理估值的区间之后，前者觉得不够成长而卖出，后者又觉得不够便宜而观望，就会加速下跌，一直阴跌，天天无量空跌。\n\n高估值的股票有人疯抢哄抢，低估值的股票有人默默收集，就是合理估值的股票无人问津。\n\n欢迎预约我周三（明天）的直播，聊聊行情何时见底","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MTk5OTY4Mw==&mid=2649662855&idx=1&sn=b418869922f86de2c95e56c5da3784c3&chksm=89f43858320d9a282a47f2c4f0ce95aceccb2e0caa85ea4afb9f141b103b1021a77932dbd60f&scene=126&sessionid=1795488851#rd","description":"","type":"article","published":"2026-11-03T11:12:11.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MTk5OTY4Mw%3D%3D:2649662852:1","title":"除了银行，还有哪些板块能躲股灾？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MTk5OTY4Mw==&mid=2649662852&idx=1&sn=6542a9ad76366b67a1fc7b2bae84466a&chksm=89bec6168e922b9f8919a0469eddd1ea1bd0e891bfde06fe104f8d4a985590abf3c7f7dd5c3a&scene=126&sessionid=1795488851#rd","description":"20年A股防御板块大复盘","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FoiaHIzp5rfuPmr3O90ib5zM0ibftyWbywrcDGnfAKFWiaExkMrr0jmKOLicAcaKYl89ibZh0OgJ4zW2zxpYeOZicOw9AI6090lJoBjYzN3e4KFGSxc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-01T12:27:53.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MTk5OTY4Mw%3D%3D:2649662852:2","title":"投资高手解读政策，重点看这4个地方","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MTk5OTY4Mw==&mid=2649662852&idx=2&sn=4a75ce448656d44a6e5e096f5aa45a2b&chksm=89d422f9ad081ad294b121d2351e7848552dbc4d498549904fd0ecfdddbd47e861f08c58302a&scene=126&sessionid=1795488851#rd","description":"公众号规则是部分推送，您只有设了星标⭐️，才能及时接收最新推送踩油门还是踩刹车1/4政策解读技巧一：比较法10","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FvOmpibibGQiaXgEfUYO45p1S52Uqup3LpVWWMWjK58FKsNViazHMC8BLb3Xibbn1x0qtyFOMDIVQejee4SlFRAialMyIyp9q